  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Peer feedback workshop kit scope"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Working agreement | Version 1 | 29 September 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Create a small workshop kit that a facilitator can use to guide eight adults through a 45 minute peer…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Deliverable"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Supply an editable facilitator guide, a participant worksheet and PDF print copies. Include one worked…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Intended use"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The example kit supports one facilitated session. Participants bring a short draft that they are…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Scope boundary"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "If a collaborator needs work outside this boundary, use the change record on page 4 before adding it to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Acceptance checks"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Agree the checks before production. A reviewer records the result against the exact version supplied.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Review evidence"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Record the tested filename, version and date. Attach the rehearsal notes and print-check results to the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "When a check fails"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The author revises the affected source and regenerates the export. The reviewer repeats the failed…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Acceptance result and reviewer: _____________________________________________ Exact version and date:…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Responsibilities and dependencies"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Work sequence"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "First, the content lead confirms the task and worked example. Next, the author drafts the complete kit.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Dependency that can stop the schedule"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "If the learning task or participant group changes after drafting starts, pause the affected work and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Review arrangement"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The collaborators agree a review date after the first complete draft is available. The reviewer…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Draft due: __________________ Review due: __________________ Content owner: ______________ Acceptance…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Handoff location"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Store the accepted kit and its source in the agreed project folder. The version note identifies the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Changes and closeout"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A change is a proposed revision to the agreed audience, output, scope, timing or acceptance checks.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Change request"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Requested change and reason: ______________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Affected output or acceptance check: ________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Impact review"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The author and reviewer identify the extra work, any dependency and the effect on the agreed date. The…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision and updated scope: ________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision owner and date: __________________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Closeout record"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Confirm that the agreed checks pass, the editable files and exports are present, and the receiving…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Accepted version and folder: _______________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Remaining limitation or future request: _______________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Received by and date: _____________________________________________________"
    }
